WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Linda Park: We're seeing more rejected lots lately, let's check if the sampling plan needs adjusting.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Omar Haddad: Packaging damage is the top rejection reason, not a dimensional issue.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Linda Park: That lines up with the open supplier corrective action on pallet packaging.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Theo Marsh: Let's hold off on changing the sampling plan until that corrective action closes out.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Linda Park: Agreed, I'll revisit this once we have two clean shipment cycles from the supplier.
